  "description": "Go for an untamed ride on a sophisticated bike. The Double Peak 27.5\" Expert is a high-performance 27.5 hardtail, with a completely new X6 Series smooth-welded aluminum chassis, lightweight Shimano 1x10 Deore / SLX / FSA drivetrain and Ritchey components, and SR Raidon-XC-RLR 100mm travel suspension fork w/ remote lock-out. Bred for speed and designed for thrills, the Double Peak 27.5\" Expert will carry you confidently on your next mountain bike adventure.\nNew frame design with low standover height & internal cable routing\nNew 14, 16, 18 & 20-inch sizes\nSuntour Raidon-XC-RLR-27.5, 100mm travel, air spring w/ remote Lock-out\nFSA \"1x\" Comet Modular crankset, 30T Megatooth Crmo Chainring\nShimano Deore RD-M615 Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nSunRace CSMS3 11-40T 10-Speed cassette\nShimano Deore SL-M610 1x10 right shifter\nShimano BR-M395 hydraulic disc brakeset\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5*2.05 tires\nPivit alloy Light, 25mm riser handlebar, 680 to 720mm width\nRitchey 4-Axis 6D stem & Trail Lock On grips",
